## Decisions and Action Items

### Decisions
1.  **DoNotModify / Benign Changes**: The WG decided not to incorporate specific benign modification rules or a `DoNotModify` flag deck ([Clayton DoNotModify](https://datatracker.ietf.org/meeting/127/materials/slides-127-dkim-clayton-donotmodify-00)) into `draft-ietf-dkim-dkim2-spec` due to lack of implementation interest and high specification complexity.
2.  **DNS Tag Deprecation**: Deprecated the `h`, `n`, `s`, and `t` tags for DKIM2 keys within `draft-ietf-dkim-dkim2-dns`.

